            'Click every URL in the exported PDF: email, LinkedIn, GitHub, portfolio, certificate verification. Builder previews sometimes show a pretty label while the export stores a broken href or only the visible text with no link. Write the URL as readable text, not only as the word here. Some ATS strip links; the visible text is then the only path. Shorten nothing with a branded shortener that will rot. Do not use tracking links from a personal CRM.',
            'Check that the email is a mailto you meant, not a leftover example.com. Check that LinkedIn is your profile, not the company page. If you include a certificate URL, open it in a private window; some vendor portals require a login the recruiter does not have. In that case, keep the credential name and date and drop the dead link. Phone numbers should be text, not a tel: icon that fails on desktop. International files should include +90 if you want a call from abroad.',
